# ==============================================================================
# Example 54: Synechocystis sp. PCC 6803 - Full Cyanobacterial GEM + DSL Params
# ==============================================================================
#
# Organism: Synechocystis sp. PCC 6803 (model cyanobacterium)
# Model: iJN678 from BiGG Models (Nogales et al. 2012, BMC Syst Biol 6:143)
#   863 reactions, 795 metabolites, 622 genes
#
# This example demonstrates direct DSL gene/param definitions for a
# photoautotroph alongside the full BiGG model:
#
# 1. FULL MODEL (use_full_model=true): iJN678 loaded from BiGG
#
# 2. DIRECT GENE DEFINITIONS with key photosynthesis genes:
#    psaA (PSI reaction center): kcat=45 s^-1
#    psbA (PSII reaction center): kcat=30 s^-1
#    cbbM (RuBisCO): kcat=3.3 s^-1, km=0.02 mM (CO2)
#    zwf  (G6PDH): kcat=270 s^-1
#
# 3. DIRECT REACTION DEFINITIONS for photosynthetic ETC:
#    PSI, PSII, Cytb6f, RuBisCO reactions defined in DSL
#
# 4. ENVIRONMENT: BG-11 freshwater, 25C, pH 7.5, diurnal light
#
# Gene sequences: Real CDS from NCBI/UniProt (back-translated with Synechocystis codon usage)
#   psaA (P29254): 752 aa, 2256 bp - Photosystem I P700 reaction center subunit a
#   psbA (P16033): 361 aa, 1086 bp - Photosystem II D1 protein
#   cbbM (P54205): 470 aa, 1413 bp - RuBisCO large subunit (Form I L8S8)
#   zwf  (P73411): 509 aa, 1530 bp - Glucose-6-phosphate 1-dehydrogenase
#
# ==============================================================================

#gem organism=synechocystis_pcc6803 medium=bg11 use_full_model=true include_spontaneous=true

